Let

$$
A=
\begin{pmatrix}
4&1&1\\
1&4&1\\
1&1&4
\end{pmatrix}.
$$

Perform a complete spectral analysis:

1. find all eigenvalues;
2. find eigenspaces;
3. construct an orthonormal eigenbasis;
4. orthogonally diagonalize $A$;
5. determine rank and nullity;
6. solve $Ax=b$ for

$$
b=(6,6,6)^T
$$

using the spectral information.
